            <title><![CDATA[Learn Programming with OCaml (112 pts)]]></title>
            <link>https://usr.lmf.cnrs.fr/lpo/</link>
            <guid>49578280</guid>
            <pubDate>Sat, 05 Sep 2026 16:45:02 GMT</pubDate>
