<p><strong><em>Lerner:</em></strong><em> And Kris, her initial reaction is …</em></p>



<p><strong><em>IN-PERSON INTERVIEW, Hansen: </em></strong><em>He’s wrong. He’s talking about all the ways that it’s harmful, and it’s not. I said, it kind of makes me mad, honestly.&nbsp;</em></p>



