<p><strong><em>IN-PERSON INTERVIEW, Hansen:</em></strong><em> “Are you sure it’s wrong?” And so I kind of rolled my eyes and then I went in and I was like, OK, I’m just gonna go to the literature.&nbsp;</em></p>



<p><strong><em>Lerner:</em></strong><em> And sitting in her kitchen, Kris googles the health effects of the chemical that she had found so many years ago.</em></p>



