    <p>
      European Git hosting
    </p>
    
    <p>
      Public and private Git repos, hosted 100% in the EU, on a platform built for humans, not AI. We block slop, never use your code to train models, and focus on availability, not shiny AI features.
    </p>

    <p>
      <a href="https://pushin.eu/register" data-phx-link="redirect" data-phx-link-state="push">
        Start pushing — free 

      </a>
      
      <a href="https://pushin.eu/explore" data-phx-link="redirect" data-phx-link-state="push">
        
 Explore repos
      </a>
    </p>

    
  </div>

  

  
  

  
  <div>
    <div>
  <p>
    01
  </p>
  <div>
    <h3>
